        "heading": "3D Architectural Rendering Services",
        "lede": "Architectural rendering services turn floor plans, elevations and CAD files into photorealistic images of a building before it is built. Bella is an architectural rendering studio for home builders, real estate developers and architects across the US and Canada: residential and commercial interiors, building exteriors, streetscapes and aerials, modelled and rendered from your plans by human 3D artists, never AI, from {price:3d-rendering-service-for-architectural-visualization} a render.",
