        "alt_label": "See real projects in our portfolio",
        "alt_link": "/pages/portfolio",
        "market_heading": "What our architectural visualization services include",
        "market_text": "<p>We cover the full range of architectural visualization services for residential and commercial projects: photorealistic interior renderings, 3D exterior rendering with landscaping, sky and realistic lighting, streetscapes and aerial site views for townhome rows and subdivisions, and multi-building compositions for condo, mixed-use and large scale developments.</p><p>Every photorealistic architectural rendering is built from your architectural drawings (CAD, PDF or even hand-drawn floor plans) with materials and finishes matched to your selections, and revisions included until the image is right. Explore <a href=\"/pages/3d-interior-rendering-services\">3D interior rendering</a>, <a href=\"/pages/3d-exterior-rendering-services\">3D exterior rendering</a> and <a href=\"/products/commercial-rendering\">commercial rendering</a>, see every service on our <a href=\"/pages/3d-rendering-services\">3D rendering services</a> hub, or order directly from the <a href=\"/products/3d-rendering-service-for-architectural-visualization\">3D rendering page</a>.</p>",
        "local_heading": "An architectural rendering studio, not a rendering app",
        "local_text": "<p>AI render tools and DIY architectural rendering software produce images that look almost right, and buyers, lenders and planning boards notice the almost. Bella is an architectural rendering studio: a human 3D artist models your project, places the cameras like a photographer would, and lights the scene to sell it. That is why builders use our renders on billboards, hoardings, investor presentations and pre-sale brochures, not just listings.</p><p>Pricing is black and white: one finished image, one space or building, one camera angle, from {price:3d-rendering-service-for-architectural-visualization}, with 4K print-ready delivery and volume discounts applied automatically: 5% off at 3 or more renders, 10% at 6 or more, 15% at 11 or more and 20% at 21 or more.</p>",
        "hoods_label": "Projects we render",
        "hoods": "Custom homes, Spec builds, Townhome rows, Condo developments, Mixed-use projects, Commercial interiors, Restaurants & retail, Landscape & site views, Real estate marketing, Planning submissions",
